      "value": "<p>At 11th level, the ungermaw can now spend a use of draw breath to cast greater dispel magic as a spell-like ability, using his ungermaw level as his caster level. Only effects within the range of the ungermaw’s draw breath ability are subject to being dispelled.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/ungermaw#toc37\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
